  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline 101 Blend pairs O-TORO Black 1.23 in the mains with O-TORO SNAP White 1.25 in the crosses. The hexagonal O-TORO mains provide strong mechanical ball grip, control and spin, while the slick round O-TORO SNAP crosses reduce inter-string friction and allow the mains to slide and return faster. The result is a comfortable, controlled and highly spin-oriented dual-poly hybrid with increased string movement, fast snapback and consistent response.",

    "zh": "Toroline 101 Blend 采用 O-TORO Black 1.23 作为主线，搭配 O-TORO SNAP White 1.25 作为横线。六边形 O-TORO 主线负责提供机械咬球、控制和高旋转，而圆形低摩擦 O-TORO SNAP 横线则降低主横线之间的摩擦，让主线更容易移动并快速回位。最终形成一套以 Spin + Snapback + Control 为核心的双聚酯 Hybrid，在保持可控反馈的同时提升主线移动速度、Snapback 效率和整体旋转表现。"
  },

